cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IGVLL–LiGre, please cite it using the metadata below, and also cite IGVLL and the LiGre Lemma Bank it links (see references)."
type: dataset
title: "IGVLL–LiGre: the Greek words of the Index Graecorum Vocabulorum in Linguam Latinam linked to the LiGre Lemma Bank"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
url: "https://w3id.org/ligre/data/linksets/IGVLL/id/linkset"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ligre-lod/igvll"
authors:
  - family-names: Lemay
    given-names: Paulien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2388-9233"
    affiliation: Ghent University
abstract: >-
  A linkset from the Greek source words (etymons) of the Index Graecorum
  Vocabulorum in Linguam Latinam (IGVLL), an index of Latin loanwords from
  Greek, to their lemmas in the LiGre Lemma Bank for Ancient Greek, for every
  Greek word whose spelling matches exactly one LiGre lemma, with review
  tables of the words that are not linked yet.
keywords:
  - Ancient Greek
  - Latin
  - loanwords
  - etymology
  - lemmatization
  - linked open data
  - LiGre
  - LiLa
